# 自定义直连规则（最高优先级，用于覆盖误杀、兜底漏网之鱼及内网直连）
# 构建脚本会自动做 Trie 域名剪枝、IP CIDR 聚合、拆分 domain / ip / classical

# --- 内网与本地回环 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,local
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lan
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,home.arpa
IP-CIDR,127.0.0.0/8,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,10.0.0.0/8,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,172.16.0.0/12,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,192.168.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,100.64.0.0/10,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,::1/128,no-resolve

# --- 关键词匹配（自动分离至 classical 规则集，不拖慢 Trie 匹配性能） ---
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,biomap
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,schweb

# --- 顶级域名与个人/特定服务 ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tailscale.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xiandewuliao.online
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazonaws.com

